      "id": "claim_9ee66f4453234ae18d2b22dc7e82f7dd",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md defines the required verification gate for application changes as running npm test, npm run lint, npx tsc --noEmit, and npm run build, plus browser verification of changed UI flows when authenticated state is available, while docs-only edits instead require checking references and claims against source; npm run test:db is called out separately as needing Docker and a local stack.",
